plan_mode: executing
plan_scope: "Live Jellyfin 10.11.11 and official stable API research, typed coverage classification, notification format correctness, documentation, read-only acceptance, and release-ready PR convergence."
plan_harness: codex
plan_resume_context: "Latest stable and live server are Jellyfin 10.11.11. Exact operation execution already covers all 429 live OpenAPI operations. Current schema research falsely reports meta/WebSocket/plugin tools as endpoint gaps; classify them explicitly, preserve privacy/read-only behavior, and prove every structured output."
plan_validation[1]{text,command,expected}:
  Live compiled coverage snapshot contains no false unmatched tools and retains 100 percent operation coverage,JELLYFIN_READ_ONLY=1 JELLYFIN_E2E_USE_DIST=1 bun test tests/e2e/cli.test.ts,All read-only tests pass; full scope reports explicit non-endpoint classifications without server mutation
plan_decisions[2]{ts,author,decision,rationale,evidence}:
  "2026-08-05T19:16:11.270Z",codex-jellyfin-api-20260805,Model API coverage as direct endpoint mappings plus explicit non-endpoint transport classes.,"Fuzzy matching WebSocket, OpenAPI orchestration, compatibility analysis, or plugin-only tools to arbitrary REST operations corrupts both mapped-tool counts and agent roadmap decisions.",Sanitized live schema research and official v10.11.11 repository/release inspection.
  "2026-08-05T19:58:44.210Z",codex-jellyfin-api-20260805,Adopt bot finding for executable zero-unmatched release proof and exhaustive coverage output schemas.,"Operation coverage alone cannot prove that every endpoint-shaped CLI tool maps, and permissive schemas weaken agent contracts.",CodeRabbit review threads on docs/release-readiness.md and src/commands/schema-coverage-def.ts; focused 50-test validation passes.
plan_discoveries[2]{ts,author,text}:
  "2026-08-05T19:16:10.402Z",codex-jellyfin-api-20260805,"Official Jellyfin release v10.11.11 is the latest stable; the configured live server also reports 10.11.11 with 356 paths, 429 operations, and 257 read-only operations. All operations map, but seven tools are reported unmatched and one generic API tool is falsely mapped."
  "2026-08-05T19:16:10.857Z",codex-jellyfin-api-20260805,"The official v10.11.11 server tree contains notification models but no Notifications controller; the live OpenAPI document contains zero notification operations. The CLI notification routes are optional legacy/plugin surfaces: types degrades to unavailable, while list is unavailable on this instance."
